(text "fSW 400 kHz (RT 33.2k), FPWM + spread spectrum.   UVLO on 6.0 V / off 4.3 V (100k / 26.7k), rides through cranking dips." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 243.84 96.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3f54951b-b01f-4380-b4ea-fe22ad5b538b"))
(text "VOUT = 1.0 V x (1 + 100k / 24.9k) = 5.02 V.   Input ceramics 50 V X7R; the amp's PVDD bulk on +12V_PROT doubles as CIN-BLK." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 243.84 99.05999999999999 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ad660012-9ae0-4666-af5b-9c814d827500"))
