(text "PI_HOLD (GPIO26): config.txt gpio=26=op,dh raises it ~1 s after power-up; dtoverlay=gpio-poweroff drops it once the Pi halts." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 243.84 180.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a3336f9d-4455-479c-b42d-3e15adcac629"))
(text "Key off: the Pi syncs and halts, SYS_EN decays under 1.13 V ~2 s later and the LM74800 cuts everything (3 uA standby)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 243.84 182.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7159885a-fb8e-46fa-b358-7ece053754e9"))
(text "ACC alone holds SYS_EN ~5 s (100k x 47 uF) so a crank before the Pi boots doesn't drop power. BZT52C15 limits load dump on the cap." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 243.84 185.42000000000002 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c183e355-af99-4db0-ad9c-485aac7bd622"))
(text "Hung Pi: the BCM watchdog resets it, GPIO26 floats low (100k bleed), and the board powers off if the key is off." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 243.84 187.95999999999998 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "507228d6-d02c-4ebb-a257-2b2bd879589c"))
